From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shunya Shishido <sisidovski@chromium.org>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:02:42 -0700
Subject: [ServiceWorker] Defer clone completion callback in
 SimpleBufferManager

Post clone_complete_callback_ via
SequencedTaskRunner::GetCurrentDefault()->PostTask() in
RaceNetworkRequestSimpleBufferManager::Finish() instead of running it
synchronously.

Bug: 566136673
Change-Id: I8f5cb74a4a882334b3d7cb5d1b81987fefdc5ca4
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8474871
Commit-Queue: Shunya Shishido <sisidovski@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Yoshisato Yanagisawa <yyanagisawa@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1706765}

Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): M148's
RaceNetworkRequestSimpleBufferManager::Finish() predates the
peer_closed_watcher_ / early-return structure upstream, so the conflict was
resolved by keeping that simpler body and replacing the synchronous
clone_complete_callback_ run with the deferred PostTask exactly as upstream.
Unittest hunks did not apply and were dropped.

diff --git a/content/common/service_worker/race_network_request_simple_buffer_manager.cc b/content/common/service_worker/race_network_request_simple_buffer_manager.cc
index 2c924def2272866b0f2d4c09aab69b696964bfd0..e329841f028d0fffb4397e2c2744434838eff9b6 100644
--- a/content/common/service_worker/race_network_request_simple_buffer_manager.cc
+++ b/content/common/service_worker/race_network_request_simple_buffer_manager.cc
@@ -73,7 +73,10 @@ void RaceNetworkRequestSimpleBufferManager::Finish() {
   write_position_ = 0;
   producer_handle_.reset();
   producer_handle_watcher_.reset();
-  std::move(clone_complete_callback_).Run();
+  if (clone_complete_callback_) {
+    base::SequencedTaskRunner::GetCurrentDefault()->PostTask(
+        FROM_HERE, std::move(clone_complete_callback_));
+  }
 }
 
 void RaceNetworkRequestSimpleBufferManager::MaybeWriteData() {
